#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_wheel_survey/models/survey_survey.py:0
msgid ""
"Aucune roue n'est encore rattachée à « %(sondage)s », et en créer une "
"demande le groupe « Roue de fortune / Responsable »."
msgstr ""
"No wheel is attached to \"%(sondage)s\" yet, and creating one requires the \"Prize wheel / Manager\" group."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_wheel_survey.field_bf_wheel__source
msgid "D'où la roue tire ses candidats."
msgstr "Where the wheel draws its candidates from."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_wheel_survey.field_bf_wheel__source
msgid "Garniture"
msgstr "Source"

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_wheel_survey.field_bf_wheel__weight_by_count
msgid ""
"La roue devient la carte de ce que la salle a répondu : une réponse donnée "
"dix fois occupe dix parts."
msgstr ""
"The wheel becomes a map of what the room answered: an answer given ten times takes ten shares."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_wheel_survey/models/bf_wheel.py:0
msgid ""
"La roue « %(name)s » ne dit pas de quel sondage elle tire ses participants."
msgstr "Wheel \"%(name)s\" does not say which survey it draws its attendees from."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_wheel_survey/models/bf_wheel.py:0
msgid ""
"La roue « %(name)s » ne dit pas de quelle question elle tire ses réponses."
msgstr "Wheel \"%(name)s\" does not say which question it draws its answers from."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_wheel_survey/models/bf_wheel.py:0
msgid ""
"La séance de « %(sondage)s » n'a pas commencé : personne n'a encore rejoint."
msgstr "The session for \"%(sondage)s\" has not started: nobody has joined yet."

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_wheel_survey.selection__bf_wheel__source__session
msgid "Les participants de la séance en direct"
msgstr "The attendees of the live session"

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_wheel_survey.selection__bf_wheel__source__answers
msgid "Les réponses d'une question"
msgstr "The answers to a question"

#. module: bf_wheel_survey
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_wheel_survey.field_bf_wheel__question_id
